---
layout: layouts/app.njk
title: More
description: The teaching guide, the scope and sequence, the placement test, search, backups, and the pages about Teach Direct.
permalink: /more/
bodyClass: page-more
---
<header class="screen__head">
  <h1 class="screen__title">More</h1>
</header>

<h2 class="section-title">Teaching</h2>
<ul class="rows">
  {% for s in program.subjects %}
  <li><a class="row" href="{{ s.guideUrl }}"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Teaching guide{% if program.subjects.length > 1 %}: {{ s.name | lower }}{% endif %}</span><span class="row__sub">How to present, signal, mark, and correct</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
  {% endfor %}
  <li><a class="row" href="/curriculum/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Scope and sequence</span><span class="row__sub">Every skill and the lesson where it begins</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
  <li><a class="row" href="/sounds/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Sounds</span><span class="row__sub">Every sound and word part, how to say it, and its lesson</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
  <li><a class="row" href="/words/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Word list</span><span class="row__sub">Every word the reading lessons read, by lesson</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
  <li><a class="row" href="/stories/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Stories</span><span class="row__sub">The thirty stories, each from the lesson its words are taught</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
  <li><a class="row" href="/placement/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Placement test</span><span class="row__sub">Finds the lesson to begin with</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
  <li><a class="row" href="/search/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Search</span><span class="row__sub">Lessons, skills, and pages</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
</ul>

<h2 class="section-title">What you need</h2>
<ul class="rows">
  {% for level in program.levels %}
  <li><details class="fold" style="border:0;margin:0"><summary>{{ level.name }}</summary><div class="fold__body"><ul class="prose"><li>A phone, tablet, or computer for the lesson screen</li>{% for m in level.materials %}<li>{{ m }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></details></li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2 class="section-title">Children and records</h2>
<div data-child-picker></div>
<ul class="rows">
  <li><a class="row" href="/records/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Records</span><span class="row__sub">Each child's results, and renaming or removing a child</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
  <li><button class="row" type="button" id="btn-export-progress"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Save a backup</span><span class="row__sub">A file with every child's records, to keep or to load on another device</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/download.njk" %}</button></li>
  <li><button class="row" type="button" id="btn-import-progress"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Load a backup</span><span class="row__sub">Records in the file are added to the records here</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/upload.njk" %}</button><input type="file" id="import-progress-input" accept=".json" hidden aria-label="Backup file"></li>
  <li><button class="row row--danger" type="button" id="btn-reset-progress"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Erase this child's records</span><span class="row__sub">Lessons, tests, and facts. Notes are kept.</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/x.njk" %}</button></li>
</ul>
<p class="muted small">Records live in this browser only. Clearing the browser's site data erases them, so save a backup now and then.</p>

<h2 class="section-title">This app</h2>
<ul class="rows">
  <li><button class="row" type="button" data-install hidden><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Install the app</span><span class="row__sub">Opens like an app and works without a connection</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</button></li>
  <li><button class="row" type="button" data-sheet-open="sheet-ios-install" id="ios-install-row" hidden><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Add to the Home Screen</span><span class="row__sub">On an iPhone or iPad</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</button></li>
</ul>

<h2 class="section-title">About</h2>
<ul class="rows">
  <li><a class="row" href="/about/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">About Teach Direct</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
  <li><a class="row" href="/privacy/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Privacy</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
  <li><a class="row" href="/terms/"><span class="row__main"><span class="row__title">Terms of use</span></span>{% include "partials/icons/chevron-right.njk" %}</a></li>
</ul>
<p class="muted small">Teach Direct is free and open source. Build {{ build.version }}.</p>
<script src="/assets/js/progress.js?v={{ build.version }}"></script>

<dialog class="sheet" id="sheet-ios-install" aria-labelledby="ios-install-title">
  <form method="dialog" class="sheet__form">
    <div class="sheet__head"><h2 class="sheet__title" id="ios-install-title">Add to the Home Screen</h2></div>
    <div class="sheet__body">
      <ol class="prose">
        <li>In Safari, tap the Share button: the square with an arrow.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Add</strong>. Teach Direct opens from your Home Screen like an app and works without a connection.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="sheet__foot"><button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary" value="ok">Done</button></div>
  </form>
</dialog>
<script>
(function () {
  var ua = navigator.userAgent || "";
  var ios = /iPhone|iPad|iPod/.test(ua) || (navigator.platform === "MacIntel" && navigator.maxTouchPoints > 1);
  var standalone = window.matchMedia("(display-mode: standalone)").matches || navigator.standalone === true;
  var row = document.getElementById("ios-install-row");
  if (row && ios && !standalone) row.hidden = false;
})();
</script>
